      "than",
      "concrete",
      "implementations"
    ],
    "html": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Principle</th>\n<th>Meaning</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>S — Single Responsibility Principle</strong></td>\n<td>A class or module should have one responsibility and therefore one reason to change.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>O — Open/Closed Principle</strong></td>\n<td>Software entities should be open for extension but closed for modification.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>L — Liskov Substitution Principle</strong></td>\n<td>A child type should be usable wherever its parent type is expected without breaking correctness.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>I — Interface Segregation Principle</strong></td>\n<td>Clients should not be forced to depend on methods or interfaces they do not use. Prefer small, focused interfaces.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>D — Dependency Inversion Principle</strong></td>\n<td>High-level and low-level modules should depend on abstractions rather than concrete implementations.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n"
  },
