      "finished",
      "running",
      "common",
      "uses",
      "include",
      "data",
      "privacy",
      "factories",
      "callbacks",
      "preserving",
      "state",
      "without",
      "global"
    ],
    "html": "<p>A closure is a function that remembers variables from its lexical scope, even after the outer function has finished running.</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki github-dark-default\" style=\"background-color:#0d1117;color:#e6edf3\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">function</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\"> createCounter</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79C0FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\"> ++</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">const</span><span style=\"color:#79C0FF\"> counter</span><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\"> createCounter</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">counter</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#8B949E\">// 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">counter</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#8B949E\">// 2</span></span></code></pre><p>Common uses include data privacy, function factories, callbacks, and preserving state without global variables.</p>\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "javascript-event-loop",
    "documentSlug": "javascript",
    "sectionSlug": "event-loop",
    "title": "Event Loop",
    "documentTitle": "JavaScript Concepts",
    "file": "javascript.md",
    "category": "Frontend",
    "keywords": [
      "Event Loop",
      "event loop",
      "event",
      "loop",
      "moves",
      "queued",
      "callbacks",
      "onto",
      "call",
      "stack",
      "when",
      "empty",
      "promise",
      "microtask",
      "queue",
      "before",
      "timer",
      "task",
      "output",
      "execution",
      "order",
      "synchronous",
      "code",
      "runs",
      "first",
      "process",
      "nexttick",
      "microtasks",
      "macrotask"
    ],
    "html": "<p>The event loop moves queued callbacks onto the call stack when the stack is empty. Promise callbacks in the microtask queue run before timer callbacks in the task queue.</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki github-dark-default\" style=\"background-color:#0d1117;color:#e6edf3\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">}, </span><span style=\"color:#79C0FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#79C0FF\">Promise</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">().</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">then</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\">\"C\"</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">process.</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">nextTick</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">=></span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">    console.</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\">\"D\"</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#D2A8FF\">log</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">(</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\">\"E\"</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">);</span></span></code></pre><p>Output:</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki github-dark-default\" style=\"background-color:#0d1117;color:#e6edf3\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>A E D C B</span></span></code></pre><p>Execution order:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Synchronous code runs first → <code>A</code>, <code>E</code></li>\n<li><code>process.nextTick</code> runs before Promise microtasks → <code>D</code></li>\n<li>The Promise microtask runs → <code>C</code></li>\n<li>The timer macrotask runs → <code>B</code></li>\n</ol>\n"
  },
  {
    "id": "javascript-variable-scope-var-let-and-const",
    "documentSlug": "javascript",
