    "html": "<p>Use <code>map</code> to transform data into elements. Give every sibling a stable key based on its identity, not its array position when the list can change.</p>\n<pre class=\"shiki github-dark-default\" style=\"background-color:#0d1117;color:#e6edf3\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">    {</span><span style=\"color:#FFA657\">products.map((product</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">) =</span><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">></span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#FFA657\">article</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\"> key={product.id}</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\"> className=\"mx-auto bg-white\"</span><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">            {</span><span style=\"color:#FFA657\">/*</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#79C0FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#A5D6FF\">/}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FF7B72\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#FFA657\">/article</span><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E6EDF3\">    ))}</span></span></code></pre>"
  },
